	// Phase 1: mean[j] = (1/N) * sum_i data[i][j]
	//
	// We traverse column by column (dimension 'm'), which is ideal for the
	// column-major layout: for each feature j, the inner loop walks n
	// contiguously. We accumulate into a local scalar and write mean[j]
